  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the IWSP-Phase II is to improve the health status of the Egyptian citizens in the 4 targeted governorates in Upper Egypt namely Minya, Assuit, Sohag and Qenathus contributing to the protection of the Egyptian environment.</narrative>
